For the first time, the Citadel will open its doors to anyone who is courageous enough and able to remove all rivals and get to its caretakers. Those who can do this will receive knowledge stored inside the impregnable walls of this fortress as a reward.

This is a special expedition:
- soldiers on the road can accelerate their progress towards the goal;
- there will be an opportunity to buy many useful things in the Citadel itself, besides you can get a lot useful things from the enemies corpses on the way to Citadel;
- this expedition has two difficulty levels - for players level 4-19 and players level 20 and up;
- range of selection at the shop depends on the difficulty level of the expedition.

You can upgrade "Centurion" in various ways:

  - upgrade the walking machine itself, increasing its damage, health or armor;
  - upgrade the passive skills of the walking machine;
  - upgrade the active skill.

Also, you can research some upgrades for the "Centurion" walking machine at the Scientists board

Every time you lose 20% of your health, you gain the following bonuses:
+100 damage;
+100 damage, +5 range;
+100 damage, +5 range;
+100 damage, +200 health regen per kill.

Such as: 
Increased production of various resources by 3% and 6%;
Increased production of various resources by 5 and 15 per hour;
Reduced time of studying scientific materials by 3% and 5%;
Increased Research points of various sciences by 3% and 5%;
Increased capacity of various buildings and warehouses;
Also, various boost of stats for the troops.

The presence of Rifenthal at your base will allow:

- make a queue of science reagents converting into research points;
- make a queue of science reagents converting into science reagents of a higher level;

