You can upgrade "Tesla" both at the Scientists board and the Power complex, in various ways by:

  - increasing its damage, health and armor;
  - studying the passive skills of the unit;
  - studying the active skill.

You can choose "Tesla" project to participate in the battle in the same "Clan Units" tab of the battle preparation window as "Centurion" and "Mogran"

In the "Knowledge Day" event you will have access to special game modes where you can earn the currency of the event - "Archive Documents".

There are four event game modes: 
– Special missions; 
– Archive Missions; 
– Wandering Enemies; 
– Event Convoy.

